Project: Arena Allocator
Description: Bump-pointer allocator over an 8-slot stack-allocated i32 buffer
Operations: aalloc (returns slot index), areset (resets bump pointer)
Test:
  Allocate 8 slots, write i*7 to each
  Reset the arena
  Re-allocate 8 slots, verify values unchanged (buf still holds data)
  Try to allocate when full -> expect -1
Expected exit code: 0
